{
  "schema_version": "1.7.0",
  "id": "USN-7841-1",
  "summary": "strongswan vulnerability",
  "details": "Xu Biang discovered that the strongSwan client incorrectly handled\nEAP-MSCHAPv2 failure requests. If a user or automated system were tricked\ninto connecting to a malicious server, a remote attacker could use this\nissue to cause strongSwan to crash, resulting in a denial of service, or\npossibly execute arbitrary code.",
